          performance is not indicative of future results.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Enhanced CSS for animations */}
      <style>{`
        .preserve-3d {
          transform-style: preserve-3d;
        }
        .backface-hidden {
          backface-visibility: hidden;
          -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
        }
        .rotate-y-180 {
          transform: rotateY(180deg);
        }
        
